.0289]},{"n":"Sangonomiya Kokomi","r":[0.0815,0.703,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Furina","r":[0.125,0.703,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Yelan","r":[0.1685,0.703,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Kaedehara Kazuha","r":[0.212,0.703,0.0361,0.0289]}]}]}},"thumb":"content/genshin/builds/sangonomiyakokomi/261111-225237/en-1.t.webp","why":{"w":[{"name":"Everlasting Moonglow","text":"HP% and Healing Bonus improve sustain; Normal Attacks during Burst gain damage and refund Energy. Mostly for on-field Kokomi. On-field Burst driver."},{"name":"A Thousand Floating Dreams","text":"Large Elemental Mastery for Kokomi-owned Bloom reactions and a small team EM share. Not a standard healing-support upgrade. Bloom-trigger build."},{"name":"Thrilling Tales of Dragon Slayers","text":"At R5, swapping from Kokomi grants the next character a large ATK buff. Outstanding for teams with an ATK-scaling carry. Swap directly into the main ATK DPS. R5 recommended."},{"name":"Prototype Amber","text":"HP% boosts healing; casting Burst restores Energy and heals the team. Comfortable craftable choice for on-field or refresh builds. R5 improves Energy return."},{"name":"Hakushin Ring","text":"After Kokomi triggers an Electro reaction, grants relevant Elemental DMG Bonuses to teammates. Niche but useful in Electro-Charged teams. Kokomi must trigger an Electro-related reaction."},{"name":"Sacrificial Fragments","text":"Elemental Mastery improves Bloom damage; Skill cooldown reset can reposition the jellyfish, though it is chance-based. Bloom teams with mobile enemies. Higher refinements improve consistency."},{"name":"Fruit of Fulfillment","text":"Energy Recharge substat helps Burst uptime; its passive trades ATK for Elemental Mastery, especially useful when triggering Bloom. Bloom-focused use."},{"name":"Magic Guide","text":"Cheap Elemental Mastery option for Bloom reactions; its damage passive is inconsistent and does not boost reaction damage. Budget Bloom builds."}],"a":[{"names":["Tenacity of the Millelith"],"text":"Jellyfish hits can maintain the partywide ATK buff. Ideal for off-field Kokomi supporting an ATK-scaling carry.","stats":"ER/HP% · HP% · Healing Bonus"},{"names":["Ocean-Hued Clam"],"text":"Converts healing into extra Physical bubble damage. Excellent for Kokomi driving on-field during Burst.","stats":"HP%/ER · Hydro DMG · Healing Bonus"},{"names":["Flower of Paradise Lost"],"text":"Boosts Bloom damage when Kokomi triggers cores; only choose it when her Bloom ownership justifies an EM build.","stats":"EM/ER · EM/HP% · EM/Healing Bonus"}],"t":[{"name":"Watatsumi Winter","members":["Sangonomiya Kokomi","Kamisato Ayaka","Shenhe","Kaedehara Kazuha"],"text":"Kokomi maintains Freeze and healing with her jellyfish; Shenhe buffs Ayaka while Kazuha groups and shreds Cryo resistance.","roles":["Hydro Healer","Main DPS","Cryo Buffer","Anemo Support"]},{"name":"Blooming Tides","members":["Sangonomiya Kokomi","Nilou","Nahida","Collei"],"text":"Kokomi drives Nilou Bountiful Blooms and heals self-damage. Build EM on Kokomi; keep Deepwood on a Dendro teammate.","roles":["Bloom Driver","Bloom Support","Dendro Support","Dendro Support"]},{"name":"Storm-Surf Society","members":["Sangonomiya Kokomi","Fischl","Beidou","Sucrose"],"text":"Kokomi drives Electro-Charged while sustaining the team; Fischl and Beidou deal off-field damage, and Sucrose groups and shreds.","roles":["Hydro Driver","Electro Sub DPS","Electro Sub DPS","Anemo Support"]},{"name":"Fanfare by the Sea","members":["Sangonomiya Kokomi","Furina","Yelan","Kaedehara Kazuha"],"text":"On-field Kokomi heals the team to build Furina Fanfare while Yelan deals off-field damage and Kazuha buffs Hydro.","roles":["Hydro Driver","Hydro Buffer","Hydro Sub DPS","Anemo Support"]}],"v":"On-field Driver: 4pc Ocean-Hued Clam; HP%/ER, Hydro DMG, Healing Bonus. Burst and Normal Attacks heal the team and deal extra Clam damage.\nNilou Bloom: 4pc Flower of Paradise Lost; EM-heavy stats and Sacrificial Fragments. Trade some EM for healing if Bountiful Core self-damage is too high.\nElectro-Charged: 4pc Tenacity or Ocean-Hued Clam; Hakushin Ring if Kokomi triggers Electro reactions. Supports off-field Electro teammates.\nSkill-only Support: 4pc Tenacity with R5 Thrilling Tales; HP%/HP%/Healing Bonus. Skip Burst if 12s jellyfish uptime covers the rotation.","n":3},"seo":{"roles":["Healer / Support"],"about":"Kokomi is a versatile Hydro healer whose jellyfish applies Hydro and sustains teammates off-field. Her Burst refreshes the jellyfish and lets her heal the entire team while attacking on-field. Build HP and enough ER for your rotation.","pros":["Excellent team healing","Reliable Hydro application","Flexible reaction teams","Strong accessible weapons"],"cons":["Cannot normally CRIT","Stationary jellyfish","Burst can need high ER","Modest personal damage"],"weapons":["Everlasting Moonglow","A Thousand Floating Dreams","Thrilling Tales of Dragon Slayers","Prototype Amber","Hakushin Ring","Sacrificial Fragments","Fruit of Fulfillment","Magic Guide"],"arts":[{"sets":["Tenacity of the Millelith"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Best support"},{"sets":["Ocean-Hued Clam"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""},{"sets":["Flower of Paradise Lost"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""}],"main":["HP% / Energy Recharge","HP%","Healing Bonus / HP%"],"stats":["HP: 35,000 - 45,000+","Energy Recharge (Skill-only): 100% - 140%","Energy Recharge (Burst refresh): 160% - 220%+","Healing Bonus: Circlet preferred","Elemental Mastery (Bloom): 600 - 900+"],"vars":[{"title":"On-field Hydro Driver","role":"On-field Healer","weapons":["Everlasting Moonglow","Prototype Amber","Hakushin Ring"],"arts":[{"sets":["Ocean-Hued Clam"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Tenacity of the Millelith"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"HP% or ER Sands / Hydro DMG Goblet / Healing Bonus Circlet; prioritize Burst uptime, HP and healing.","teams":"Off-field damage teammates who benefit from Kokomi attacking during Burst.","when":"Use Kokomi on-field after Burst to heal the entire team and drive Hydro reactions; 